  "facts_of_case": "The wife, G. Anuradha, married the husband, G. Narayana Rao, in 1989. The husband filed an application for annulment of marriage on the ground that the wife was suffering from a disease known as 'Hyper Prolactinemia with Galloctorrhea' and incapable of bearing children. The trial court granted the decree of annulment under Section 12(1) (c) and (b) of the Hindu Marriage Act.",
